ime</span><b>99.98%</b></div>\n</section>\n<main class=\"ly-main\"><h2>Top products</h2>\n<div class=\"ly-row\"><span>Pro plan, yearly</span><span>$21,400</span></div>\n<div class=\"ly-row\"><span>Team seats</span><span>$15,880</span></div>\n</main>","h":376},"empty state":{"html":"<style>\n.e{text-align:center;padding:28px 20px;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface)}\n.e-ic{width:56px;height:56px;margin:0 auto 12px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--raised);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow);color:var(--link)}\n.e h3{font-size:16px}\n.e p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:6px auto 16px;max-width:260px}\n.e-a{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px}\n.e-a button{height:34px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--raised);font-weight:600}\n.e-a .go{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"e\">\n<div class=\"e-ic\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8.5l9-4.5 9 4.5-9 4.5z\"/><path d=\"M4 13l9 4.5 9-4.5M4 17.5l9 4.5 9-4.5\"/></svg></div>\n<h3>No API keys yet</h3>\n<p>Create a key to call the API from your servers. Keys never leave this workspace.</p>\n<div class=\"e-a\"><button type=\"button\">Read the docs</button><button class=\"go\" type=\"button\">Create key</button></div>\n</div>","h":280},"onboarding":{"html":"<style>\n.o{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--raised);padding:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\n.o-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.o-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px;margin:8px 0 14px}\n.o-bar i{height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--line)}\n.o-bar .on{background:var(--accent)}\n.o h3{font-size:16px}\n.o ol{list-style:none;margin:12px 0 0;padding:0}\n.o li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;font-size:14px}\n.o-ck{flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1.5px solid var(--line)}\n.o-done .o-ck{background:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok);color:var(--bg)}\n.o-done span{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through}\n.o-now{font-weight:600}\n.o-now .o-ck{border-color:var(--accent)}\n.o-go{margin-top:12px;width:100%;height:36px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent);font-weight:600}\n</style>\n<section class=\"o\" aria-label=\"Getting started\">\n<div class=\"o-top\"><span>Getting started</span><span>Step 3 of 4</span></div>\n<div class=\"o-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></div>\n<h3>Connect your repository</h3>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"o-done\"><span class=\"o-ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.5 6.2l2.2 2.2 4.8-4.8\"/></svg></span><span>Create a workspace</span></li>\n<li class=\"o-done\"><span class=\"o-ck\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.5 6.2l2.2 2.2 4.8-4.8\"/></svg></span><span>Invite your team</span></li>\n<li class=\"o-now\"><span class=\"o-ck\"></span><span>Connect GitHub</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"o-ck\"></span><span>Ship your first deploy</span></li>\n</ol>\n<button class=\"o-go\" type=\"button\">Connect GitHub</button>\n</section>","h":330}}}
